Congratulations to @DiggeridoosVT from Virginia Tech for winning the 2026 Not-a-Boring-Competition!  They mined 129” in a Texas downpour. 

Additional congrats to @TalpaUpv (Innovation Award) and to @TheBoringIllini (Rookie of the Year).

Registration opens soon for NABC 2027!










The Boring Company (@boringcompany)

The 5th annual Not-a-Boring Student Competition is almost here! 

120+ students from 8 universities across 3 countries are making final machine preparations before coming to Bastrop, TX in March to compete and see who can beat the snail!

The 8 finalists are:
@TheBoringIllini from @uofigrainger
@CU_Hyperloop from @CUEngineering
@TAMUDigEmAggies from @TAMUEngineering
@DiggeridoosVT from @virginia_tech
@Penn_Hyperloop from @PennEngineers
Smith Engineering Hyperloop from @SmithEngQueens
@TalpaUPV from @UPV
@uatxcavators from @uaustinorg

If you're a college student interested in starting a Not-a-Boring Competition team of your own, reach out to competition@boringcompany.com.







— https://nitter.net/boringcompany/status/2023312437727076596#m
